  ALL user-visible text for VAAKKU.

  Two standing rules for this file:

  1. Tamil strings are grouped and marked with a TAMIL-REVIEW comment. A native
     Tamil speaker (Dhaanish) reviews every one before the demo (build plan §8.1).
     Do not treat any Tamil here as final until that review happens.

  2. NOTHING in this file may grade a person or colour-code a state. CLAUDE.md #1
     lists the words that are forbidden anywhere in the source tree, and
     checkBannedWords enforces that list over this file too — which is why this
     comment names none of them. The three user-facing state labels are
     MATCHES / NOT_IN_DOCUMENT / DIFFERS and nothing else. If the guard fires,
     fix the string; do not relax the check.
-->
